 🟢 Level 1 — Asaan
Q1 → Ye array banao aur teesra element print karo:
["Apple", "Mango", "Banana", "Orange"]
Q2 → Is array ki length nikalo:
jsconst nums = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50];
Q3 → Is array mein "Grapes" add karo end mein:
jsconst fruits = ["Apple", "Mango"];
Q4 → Is array ka pehla aur aakhri element print karo:
jsconst colors = ["Red", "Green", "Blue", "Yellow"];

🟡 Level 2 — Thoda Mushkil
Q5 → map use karke har number ko 3 se multiply karo:
jsconst nums = [2, 4, 6, 8];
// Answer: [6, 12, 18, 24]
Q6 → filter use karke sirf 50 se zyada wale nikalo:
jsconst marks = [45, 78, 32, 91, 55];
// Answer: [78, 91, 55]
Q7 → forEach use karke har naam ko print karo:
jsconst names = ["Ali", "Sara", "Zain", "Hina"]; 
// Ali
// Sara
// Zain
// Hina
Q8 → find use karke pehla even number dhundho:
jsconst nums = [3, 7, 2, 8, 5];
// Answer: 2

🟠 Level 3 — Mushkil
Q9 → reduce use karke sab ka sum nikalo:
jsconst nums = [5, 10, 15, 20];
// Answer: 50
Q10 → some use karke check karo kya koi negative number hai:
jsconst nums = [3, 7, -2, 8, 5];
// Answer: true
Q11 → every use karke check karo kya sab numbers even hain:
jsconst nums = [2, 4, 6, 8];
// Answer: true
Q12 → map aur filter saath use karo:
jsconst nums = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];
// Pehle sirf even nikalo
// Phir unhe double karo
// Answer: [4, 8]

🔴 Level 4 — Advanced
Q13 → Is array of objects se sirf pass students ke naam nikalo filter aur map se:
jsconst students = [
  { naam: "Ali",  marks: 45 },
  { naam: "Sara", marks: 78 },
  { naam: "Zain", marks: 33 },
  { naam: "Hina", marks: 91 },
];
// 50 se zyada = pass
// Answer: ["Sara", "Hina"]
Q14 → reduce use karke sabse chota number nikalo:
jsconst nums = [8, 3, 11, 1, 9];
// Answer: 1
Q15 → reduce use karke count karo kitne log 18 se zyada umar ke hain:
jsconst users = [
  { naam: "Ali",  umar: 15 },
  { naam: "Sara", umar: 22 },
  { naam: "Zain", umar: 19 },
  { naam: "Hina", umar: 14 },
];
// Answer: 2 